{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/304da3343808cc3f49c163e09daa42e7.avif?t=1758036571\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br>In the borderlands of Camelot, legends whisper on every wind. But when the Ashen Knight and his dragon turn your home to ash, the fairy tale becomes a war. All you have left is the will to survive\u2014and the desire to uncover the truth about your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will lead into the heart of a cursed fortress, where an ancient oath between knights and dragons waits to be restored\u2026 or destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Explore enchanting yet dangerous lands\u2014from flooded caves to burning citadels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Discover hidden objects and clues that lead to Camelot\u2019s buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Challenge the Ashen Knights and break the chains that bind dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Solve intricate puzzles to reveal legends and long-forgotten truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Become the hero of the legend\u2014or its final casualty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the cursed walls, an ancient darkness stirs\u2026 and it already knows your name\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948140?t=1758036571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948140?t=1758036571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/6c29f8b3cd35a68cd33f4ed90ec2a891b2f97437/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758036571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/6c29f8b3cd35a68cd33f4ed90ec2a891b2f97437/capsule_184x69.jpg